flowchart TB
  MIKE[Mike with SSH key]
  TG[Telegram API]
  S3[S3-compatible off-site storage]
  SG[Selectel security group: TCP 22 only]

  subgraph VPS[Selectel Cloud VPS: staging then pilot - Ubuntu 24.04, 2 vCPU, 4 GiB RAM, 80 GiB NVMe]
    HOST[Hardened host: SSH key only, no root or password login]
    MONITOR[systemd capacity monitor: recommend only]
    NET[Internal Docker network]
    SCHED[TypeScript scheduler and worker]
    PG[(PostgreSQL 16)]
    HEALTH[Python Data Health on localhost]
    BACKUP[Restic backup job]
    RAW[(Private raw and manifest volumes)]
    SECRETS[Docker secret files]

    SCHED --> PG
    SCHED --> RAW
    HEALTH -->|read-only role| PG
    BACKUP --> PG
    BACKUP --> RAW
    SECRETS --> SCHED
    SECRETS --> PG
    SECRETS --> BACKUP
    NET --- SCHED
    NET --- PG
    NET --- HEALTH
    HOST --> MONITOR
    HOST --> NET
  end

  SG --> HOST
  MIKE -->|SSH TCP 22| HOST
  MIKE -->|SSH tunnel only| HEALTH
  SCHED -->|sanitized status only| TG
  MONITOR -->|sanitized capacity only| TG
  BACKUP -->|encrypted repository| S3

  PUBLIC[Public inbound traffic]
  PUBLIC -. blocked .-> PG
  PUBLIC -. blocked .-> HEALTH
